    "updated_at": "2020-09-25T09:06:37Z",
    "body": "Moreover, when `package.json` is used (in a mixed language project) by the bundler the package is usually marked as private (I see that at the moment Starship doesn't show the version for a private `package.json` file). My first idea was indeed to simply skip it when marked as private but  I guess adding the check only for  `package.json`  would probably lead to some inconsistencies.",
